WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.200
As a symbol of national renewal, today

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.400
we gather by the same runway that once

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.100
stood cracked [music] and silent

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.600
to announce that this very site will

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.000
soon be the premiere venue for the air

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.600
and space

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.650
demonstrations

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.400
from all over the world under the Trump

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.100
[music] administration.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.300
Our ambition is back, our momentum is

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.700
back, our leadership is back, [music]

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.000
NASA is back, and above all, most

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:34.000
importantly, the United [music] States

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.600
of America is back. To the entire team

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.500
at NASA who have worked to make this

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.000
vision a [music] real reality, a

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.900
beautiful, a gorgeous reality,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.200
congratulations [music] on this historic

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.520
achievement.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.200
There could be no better place to

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.100
[music] launch the next generation of

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.500
American breakthroughs than Cape

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.500
Canaveral and the Kennedy Space Center

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.400
where America's future [music]

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.400
will take flight.
